1
00:00:00,090 --> 00:00:03,070
(Raj:)All right, just this once
you may close the door.

2
00:00:03,070 --> 00:00:05,530
(Raj:)But keep in mind
I'll be right out here

3
00:00:05,530 --> 00:00:07,130
(Raj:)monitoring the situation!

4
00:00:20,740 --> 00:00:22,340
(Raj:)Oh, damn it.

5
00:00:22,340 --> 00:00:25,610
(Raj:)Leonard, when you get this
message, call me.

6
00:00:31,890 --> 00:00:34,860
(Raj:)Priya, this is your brother.

7
00:00:34,860 --> 00:00:37,790
(Raj:)When you get this, tell Leonard
to check his voicemail.

8
00:00:40,900 --> 00:00:43,360
(Sheldon:)Would you be sleeping over
again this evening?

9
00:00:43,360 --> 00:00:44,830
(Sheldon:)Because you're welcome to.

10
00:00:44,830 --> 00:00:47,000
(Howard:)That's very nice of you,
but I made other plans.

11
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:50,140
(Sheldon:)Well, just keep in mind that
should you ever need

12
00:00:50,140 --> 00:00:55,340
(Sheldon:)a slightly apathetic tertiary
friend, I stand at the ready.

13
00:00:55,340 --> 00:00:57,240
(Priya:)Hi, Howard.
Hi, Sheldon.

14
00:00:57,240 --> 00:00:58,240
(Sheldon:)Hello.
Hey.

